{
  "_comment": [
    "How the gallery groups itself. EDITABLE DATA, not code.",
    "",
    "Three kinds of facet, in increasing order of how much they assume:",
    "",
    "  field    read straight off the image record. Collection and tags are",
    "           yours; nothing infers them.",
    "  derived  computed from stored metadata -- dimensions, Midjourney",
    "           parameters. Always true, never a guess.",
    "  lexicon  matched against the prompt text using the terms below. This is",
    "           the only kind that can be WRONG, which is why the terms are",
    "           written down here where you can see and change them rather",
    "           than inferred by something you would have to argue with.",
    "",
    "A lexicon term matches on whole words only, so 'gold' does not fire on",
    "'golden retriever' by accident but 'golden' does, because it is listed.",
    "Delete a group and it disappears from the panel. Add one and it appears."
  ],
